## Comparisons and limits
Concentrated versus diversified four-success training; A removal and restoration;
B unknown/known-ineffective/unavailable; informationally learned substitute; no demand;
other cue; equal corrected beliefs/different acquired history; false/denied receipt;
hidden physical changes with identical later safe views; actual failed execution;
mean versus latest response to contradiction; serious expectation-only comparator.
Do not require history necessity when expectation-only already explains substitution.
MEC011 and EXP004 preserve available versus learned access; MEC012..017/019 and
EXP009/010 preserve reasons/dice and choice/execution. MEC018 identity feedback and
MEC020 lifecycle remain separate controls, not newly integrated. EXP003 cue acquisition
is retained; no historical mechanism or distinction retired. RO008/010/012/015/019/020
retain natural source, learning, resource, integration and broader addiction limits.
No escalating reinforcement, tolerance, withdrawal, craving or relapse claim.

